      "message": "I will add a transition for that. It is re-synchronization task. When syncing_alarm does not get success, the trigger is mismatch. The state will happen.  \n        {\u0027trigger\u0027: \u0027timeout\u0027, \u0027source\u0027: \u0027resynchronizing\u0027, \u0027dest\u0027: \u0027starting\u0027},\n        {\u0027trigger\u0027: \u0027success\u0027, \u0027source\u0027: \u0027resynchronizing\u0027, \u0027dest\u0027: \u0027syncing_alarm\u0027},",
